# The who-line ranks consumers by the MEASURED quantity (RSS or rate), not by
# process count. In census-full.json the orphaned helpers (23 procs, 1.6 GB)
# outnumber Slack (14, 2.1 GB) but are smaller, so the two rankings disagree at
# position three (WS2a).
file: rust/banshee-core/src/pressure/who.rs
test: the_memory_who_ranks_by_resident_size_not_process_count
---OLD---
        b.measure
            .partial_cmp(&a.measure)
---NEW---
        (b.count as f64)
            .partial_cmp(&(a.count as f64))
